{"meta":{"ui":"dashboard","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show me how the product did this month as an inline dashboard with a toggle between 7, 30 and 90 days that changes every number. Four stat tiles with their change, each period: 7 days: revenue $18.4k (+4.1%), sign-ups 312 (+6.0%), churn 2.9% (-0.2%), active users 13,870 (+1.4%); 30 days: $78.9k (+8.5%), 1,340 (+11.2%), 3.1% (+0.4%), 14,260 (+6.3%); 90 days: $221k (+15.3%), 3,905 (+9.8%), 3.4% (-0.6%), 14,260 (+12.1%). A line chart of revenue over the period, and a bar chart of sign-ups by channel (Organic, Paid, Referral, Social, Email) that adds up to the sign-ups: 7 days 128, 84, 52, 31, 17; 30 days 540, 372, 218, 134, 76; 90 days 1,580, 1,010, 640, 420, 255. Under them a table of the top five plans I can sort by any column, starting with revenue, highest first: Pro 1,340 subs, $38,900, churn 2.1%; Team 412, $24,700, 1.4%; Starter 2,980, $8,900, 5.2%; Business 96, $4,800, 0.9%; Student 640, $1,600, 6.8%.","text":"state range=\"30 days\"\nstate sort=\"revenue\"\nstate desc=true\nstate rev=[{\"d\":\"d1\",\"v\":0}]\nChatCard \"Product this month\" \"Last {range}\" icon:\"bar_chart\" status:\"Live\"\n  Segments =range options:[\"7 days\",\"30 days\",\"90 days\"]\n  if range==\"7 days\"\n    Grid cols:2 gap:10\n      StatTile \"Revenue\" \"vs prior\" value:\"$18.4k\" delta:\"+4.1%\"\n      StatTile \"Sign-ups\" \"vs prior\" value:\"312\" delta:\"+6.0%\"\n      StatTile \"Churn\" \"vs prior\" value:\"2.9%\" delta:\"-0.2%\" invert:true\n      StatTile \"Active users\" \"vs prior\" value:\"13,870\" delta:\"+1.4%\"\n  if range==\"30 days\"\n    Grid cols:2 gap:10\n      StatTile \"Revenue\" \"vs prior\" value:\"$78.9k\" delta:\"+8.5%\"\n      StatTile \"Sign-ups\" \"vs prior\" value:\"1,340\" delta:\"+11.2%\"\n      StatTile \"Churn\" \"vs prior\" value:\"3.1%\" delta:\"+0.4%\" invert:true\n      StatTile \"Active users\" \"vs prior\" value:\"14,260\" delta:\"+6.3%\"\n  if range==\"90 days\"\n    Grid cols:2 gap:10\n      StatTile \"Revenue\" \"vs prior\" value:\"$221k\" delta:\"+15.3%\"\n      StatTile \"Sign-ups\" \"vs prior\" value:\"3,905\" delta:\"+9.8%\"\n      StatTile \"Churn\" \"vs prior\" value:\"3.4%\" delta:\"-0.6%\" invert:true\n      StatTile \"Active users\" \"vs prior\" value:\"14,260\" delta:\"+12.1%\"\n  if range==\"7 days\"\n    ChartCard \"Revenue\" value:\"$18.4k\" values:[2.1,2.4,2.2,2.8,2.6,3.0,3.3] labels:[\"Mon\",\"Tue\",\"Wed\",\"Thu\",\"Fri\",\"Sat\",\"Sun\"] kind:\"line\" delta:\"+4.1%\"\n    ChartCard \"Sign-ups by channel\" value:\"312\" values:[128,84,52,31,17] labels:[\"Organic\",\"Paid\",\"Referral\",\"Social\",\"Email\"] kind:\"bars\" delta:\"+6.0%\"\n  if range==\"30 days\"\n    ChartCard \"Revenue\" value:\"$78.9k\" values:[18,21,19,24,22,27,30] labels:[\"W1\",\"W2\",\"W3\",\"W4\",\"W5\",\"W6\",\"W7\"] kind:\"line\" delta:\"+8.5%\"\n    ChartCard \"Sign-ups by channel\" value:\"1,340\" values:[540,372,218,134,76] labels:[\"Organic\",\"Paid\",\"Referral\",\"Social\",\"Email\"] kind:\"bars\" delta:\"+11.2%\"\n  if range==\"90 days\"\n    ChartCard \"Revenue\" value:\"$221k\" values:[62,70,68,80,84,92,98] labels:[\"M1\",\"M2\",\"M3\",\"M4\",\"M5\",\"M6\",\"M7\"] kind:\"line\" delta:\"+15.3%\"\n    ChartCard \"Sign-ups by channel\" value:\"3,905\" values:[1580,1010,640,420,255] labels:[\"Organic\",\"Paid\",\"Referral\",\"Social\",\"Email\"] kind:\"bars\" delta:\"+9.8%\"\n  Text.strong \"Top plans\"\n  TableHeader =sort desc:desc columns:[\"Plan\",\"Subs\",\"Revenue\",\"Churn\"] keys:[\"plan\",\"subs\",\"revenue\",\"churn\"]\n  each p in sortByDesc(plans,p=>p.revenue)\n    TableRow cells:=[p.plan,p.subs,money(p.revenue,\"$\",0),p.churn]\n  if sort==\"revenue\"\n    Text.muted \"Sorted by revenue\"","usage":{"input_tokens":9384,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1295